],"participants":[{"person":"liuliao-p0002","role":"怀疑妻有私、使卒挝妻弃遣","evidence":["liuliao-q-91104c5603df03cdd06e"]},{"person":"liuliao-p0009","role":"入贺太后被留经月、被挝弃遣","evidence":["liuliao-q-91104c5603df03cdd06e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-91104c5603df03cdd06e"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-91104c5603df03cdd06e","source_order":[40,241,20],"order":7300},{"id":"liuliao-e-o046","title":"胡氏告琰琰坐下狱竟弃市","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-2321ea96842a258de64e","label":"正文","text":"胡氏告琰琰坐下狱竟弃市","evidence":["liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liuliao-p0009","role":"具以告言琰","evidence":["liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4"]},{"person":"liuliao-p0002","role":"坐下狱、竟弃市","evidence":["liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4","source_order":[40,242,0],"order":7301}],"persons":[{"id":"liuliao-p0002","name":"刘琰","evidence":["liuliao-q-0c46ad410d768e7e84a7","liuliao-q-d807f0f45333d04f54b6","liuliao-q-91104c5603df03cdd06e","liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4","liuliao-q-b30598f2b6891fcd098f","liuliao-q-e6ccc26c45edeab0b1bc","liuliao-q-9ae5ceba250bbfd4ea55"],"facts":[{"id":"liuliao-f-54d0368de0d9b181ec28","text":"字威硕","evidence":["liuliao-q-e6ccc26c45edeab0b1bc"]},{"id":"liuliao-f-fce83277c65a92fbc102","text":"鲁国人","evidence":["liuliao-q-e6ccc26c45edeab0b1bc"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"liuliao-m-90f55948e1355a2d6949","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及刘琰","evidence":["liuliao-q-d9665bbb91f9df502fd4"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-9b1b42eb9b3cad1c7740","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-aa10e5f0d2cfeb33df76","layer":"original","quote":"都护李平坐诬罔废","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O024","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-13322259e3385d3184d4","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，都护李平废徙梓潼郡。〖11〗﹝二﹞","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-0c46ad410d768e7e84a7","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-56932ac6330961d5c6d5","layer":"original","quote":"后主立，封都乡侯〖4〗；班位每亚李严。为卫尉、中军师、后将军〖5〗。迁车骑将军，然不豫国政；但领兵千余，随丞相亮讽议而已。车服饮食，号为侈靡；侍婢数十，皆能为声乐，又悉教诵读《鲁灵光殿赋》〖6〗。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":238,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-91104c5603df03cdd06e","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-0db36ab57dd04b79dd41","layer":"original","quote":"十二年正月〖16〗，琰妻胡氏入贺太后；太后令特留胡氏，经月乃出。胡氏有美色，琰疑其与后主有私；呼卒五百挝胡〖17〗，至于以履搏面〖18〗，而后弃遣〖19〗。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-9ae5ceba250bbfd4ea55","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-0db36ab57dd04b79dd41","layer":"original","quote":"于是亮遣琰还成都，官位如故。琰失志慌惚。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-a8c6eaae2d4d4e8506b4","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-e38db0cdb51ec11fb3f3","layer":"original","quote":"胡具以告言琰〖20〗，琰坐下狱。有司议曰：“卒，非挝妻之人；面，非受履之地。”琰竟弃市〖21〗。自是，大臣妻、母朝庆遂绝","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-b30598f2b6891fcd098f","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-3973f0a63d7652cc65db","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞亮公文上尚书曰：“平为大臣，受恩过量；不思忠报，横造无端；危耻不办，迷罔上下；论狱弃科，导人为奸；狭情志狂，若无天地！自度奸露，嫌心遂生；闻军临至，西向托疾还沮、（漳）〔沔〕；军临至沮，复还江阳，平参军狐忠勤谏乃止。今篡贼未灭，社稷多难；国事惟和，可以克捷；不可苞含，以危大业。辄与行中军师，车骑将军、都乡侯臣刘琰，使持节、前军师、征西大将军、领凉州刺史、南郑侯臣魏延，前将军、都亭侯臣袁綝，左将军、领荆州刺史、高阳乡侯臣吴壹，督前部、右将军、玄乡侯臣高翔，督后部、后将军、安乐亭侯臣吴班，领长史、绥军将军臣杨仪，督左部、行中监军、扬武将军臣邓芝，行前监军、征南将军臣刘巴，行中护军、偏将军臣费祎，行前护军、偏将军、汉成亭侯臣许允，行左护军、笃信中郎将臣丁咸，行右护军、偏将军臣刘敏，行护军、征（南）〔西〕将军、当阳亭侯臣姜维，行中典军、讨虏将军臣上官雍，行中参军、昭武中郎将臣胡济，行参军、建义将军臣阎晏，行参军、偏将军臣爨习，行参军、裨将军臣杜义，行参军、武略中郎将臣杜祺，行参军、绥戎都尉臣盛勃，领从事中郎、武略中郎将臣樊岐等议：辄解平任，免官禄、节传、印绶、符策，削其爵土。”","attribution":"裴注·诸葛亮公文上尚书","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-63939405533bf19c17e7","start":0,"end":495,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-c6e6f60db0bf0cbc289a","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-730d9183607041ebec12","layer":"original","quote":"乃废平为民，徙梓潼郡","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-d807f0f45333d04f54b6","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c24ccd61e287cf0029eb","layer":"original","quote":"建兴十年，与前军师魏延不和〖7〗，言语虚诞。亮责让之，琰与亮笺谢曰：“琰禀性空虚，本薄操行，加有酒荒之病〖8〗；自先帝以来，纷纭之论〖9〗，殆将倾覆〖10〗。颇蒙明公本其一心在国，原其身中秽垢；扶持全济，致其禄位，以至今日。间者迷醉，言有违错；慈恩含忍，不致之于理〖11〗；使得全完，保育性命。虽必克己责躬〖12〗，改过投死〖13〗，以誓神灵；无所用命〖14〗，则靡寄颜〖15〗。”","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-d9665bbb91f9df502fd4","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c6ce1a9ba0d2a56939d4","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：刘封处嫌疑之地，而思防不足以自卫；彭羕、廖立以才拔进；李严以干局达〖1〗；魏延以勇略任；杨仪以当官显；刘琰旧仕〖2〗：并咸贵重。览其举措，迹其规矩〖3〗；招祸取咎，无不自己也〖4〗。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":355,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-e6ccc26c45edeab0b1bc","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-94200d3ee43dee77c09b","layer":"original","quote":"刘琰字威硕，鲁国人也〖1〗。先主在豫州，辟为从事。以其宗姓，有风流〖2〗，善谈论，厚亲待之。遂随从周旋，常为宾客。先主定益州，以琰为固陵太守〖3〗。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":237,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"liuliao-p0002":{"fields":[{"id":"liuliao-p0002-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"威硕","evidence":["liuliao-q-e6ccc26c45edeab0b1bc"]}],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
